-- ============================================================ RARITIES / WEAPONS / CHESTS
-- The rarer the weapon, the stronger the basic attack AND the bigger / stronger / cheaper its abilities:
--   dmg  = basic damage multiplier          asp = attack speed multiplier       rng = range multiplier
--   crit = extra crit chance                am  = ability damage multiplier     rs  = ability size (radius / length)
--   cnt  = extra projectiles / jumps / meteors   cdr = ability cooldown multiplier   sell = coins for a duplicate
