-- Chest prices are tied to what a run pays (coins per victory, Whispering Forest / Gloomrock Cave):
--   Easy    ~  350 /  ~  850        Normal ~  800 / ~ 1900        Hard ~ 1400 / ~ 3500
--   Insane  ~ 2500 / ~ 6000         Impossible ~ 4300 / ~ 10000
-- Wooden chest = a bit less than ONE easy run, Iron = one easy cave run, Gold = one hard cave run,
-- Void = one Impossible cave run.  x10 opening gets a discount.
